{"type":"message","id":"e19b8a63","parentId":"3f1a89d8","timestamp":"2026-05-29T19:00:55.624Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Fri 2026-05-29 19:00 UTC] Write a dream diary entry from these memory fragments:\n\n- Session: 2026-05-21 19:23:49 UTC: **Session Key**: agent:lucus:feishu:lucus:direct:ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a; **Session ID**: 4af9be2f-0106-4f73-b81d-699b0357495e; **Source**: feishu\n- Conversation Summary: assistant: [assistant turn failed before producing content] assistant: [assistant turn failed before producing content] assistant: [assistant turn failed before producing content] assistant: [assistant turn failed before producing content]\n- Conversation Summary: user: Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n- Conversation Summary: \"chat_id\": \"user:ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\", \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6fc17b7e8c68eea81920de3d7cd\", \"reply_to_id\": \"om_x100b6fdff63a3ca8ee8d450536ae34a\", \"sender_id\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\",\n- Conversation Summary: \"sender\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\", \"timestamp\": \"Thu 2026-05-21 18:47 UTC\", \"has_reply_context\": true\n- Conversation Summary: Sender (untrusted metadata):\n- Conversation Summary: \"label\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\", \"id\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\", \"name\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\"\n- Conversation Summary: Reply target of current user message (untrusted, for context):\n- Conversation Summary: \"body\": \"⚠️ Cron job \\\"config\\\\-backup\\\\-8am\\\" failed: EmbeddedAttemptSessionTakeoverError: session file changed while embedded prompt lock was released: /home/node/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/e4936a00\\\\-5ae8\\\\-411e\\\\-b73b\\\\-5f2262f60553.jsonl\"\n- Conversation Summary: [message_id: om_x100b6fc17b7e8c68eea81920de3d7cd] ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a: [Replying to: \"⚠️ Cron job \"config\\-backup\\-8am\" failed: EmbeddedAttemptSessionTakeoverError: se